{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Embrace the Darkness. Seek Vengeance. Summon the Goddess.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your dark fortress from relentless waves of villagers as you draw arcane runes to summon Ilur, the death goddess who brought you back to life in <strong>Runeomicon</strong>, a uniquely dark tower defense game. Harness your arcane power to unleash eldritch horrors and fortify your defenses to keep the ritual alive. Use your power wisely\u2014every decision could lead to victory or ruin, as the villagers will stop at nothing to end the ritual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAIN POWER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Channel arcane energy by drawing intricate runes. Begin your journey by summoning minor gods as you master your growing power. Use this energy to unleash devastating spells, strengthen your defenses against the relentless siege, or enhance the complexity of your runes. The more intricate the runes, the stronger your magic becomes\u2014but be warned, stronger runes mean greater risk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160570/extras/ea8179526d72cebfa8740c4e8affbcba.poster.avif?t=1761247782\" width=630 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160570/extras/ea8179526d72cebfa8740c4e8affbcba.webm?t=1761247782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160570/extras/ea8179526d72cebfa8740c4e8affbcba.mp4?t=1761247782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE VILLAGERS WILL NOT STOP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face wave after wave of increasingly dangerous enemies, from common villagers to heavily armed knights. Their fury grows as your magic intensifies, and if they breach your defenses, your dark ambitions will end in ruin. You must be prepared to counter their every move, deploying lethal defenses that can turn the tide, or your ritual will be forever undone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160570/extras/6fd625a39faf46be56213d56a3109af9.poster.avif?t=1761247782\" width=680 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160570/extras/6fd625a39faf46be56213d56a3109af9.webm?t=1761247782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160570/extras/6fd625a39faf46be56213d56a3109af9.mp4?t=1761247782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BALANCE POWER AND DEFENSE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between increasing your power or reinforcing your defenses. Will you sacrifice power for stronger runes, or invest in fortified towers, spells, gargoyle guardians, eldritch creatures and more devastating defenses to repel the onslaught? To survive, you must decide when to seize power and when to defend your stronghold. Every choice shapes your chances of succeeding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160570/extras/6c9d514f79b98f3810abe0d32fcb4aaa.poster.avif?t=1761247782\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160570/extras/6c9d514f79b98f3810abe0d32fcb4aaa.webm?t=1761247782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160570/extras/6c9d514f79b98f3810abe0d32fcb4aaa.mp4?t=1761247782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PROGRESS THROUGH DARK RITUALS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase your power as you progress from village to village, summoning each minor god until you are ready to call forth Ilur herself, the goddess of death. But be warned\u2014the stronger your magic, the more formidable your foes become. Only if you master both offense and defense will you achieve your ultimate vengeance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defy death. Embrace the darkness. <strong>The ritual must continue\u2014no matter the cost.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3160570?t=1761247782","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3160570?t=1761247782","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160570/b9386ba78cf8b584d37d6247af022664975a3536/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761247782","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160570/b9386ba78cf8b584d37d6247af022664975a3536/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761247782","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Embrace the Darkness. Seek Vengeance. Summon the Goddess.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your dark fortress from relentless waves of villagers as you draw arcane runes to summon Ilur, the death goddess who brought you back to life in <strong>Runeomicon</strong>, a uniquely dark tower defense game. Harness your arcane power to unleash eldritch horrors and fortify your defenses to keep the ritual alive. Use your power wisely\u2014every decision could lead to victory or ruin, as the villagers will stop at nothing to end the ritual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAIN POWER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Channel arcane energy by drawing intricate runes. Begin your journey by summoning minor gods as you master your growing power. Use this energy to unleash devastating spells, strengthen your defenses against the relentless siege, or enhance the complexity of your runes. The more intricate the runes, the stronger your magic becomes\u2014but be warned, stronger runes mean greater risk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160570/extras/ea8179526d72cebfa8740c4e8affbcba.poster.avif?t=1761247782\" width=630 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160570/extras/ea8179526d72cebfa8740c4e8affbcba.webm?t=1761247782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160570/extras/ea8179526d72cebfa8740c4e8affbcba.mp4?t=1761247782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE VILLAGERS WILL NOT STOP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face wave after wave of increasingly dangerous enemies, from common villagers to heavily armed knights. Their fury grows as your magic intensifies, and if they breach your defenses, your dark ambitions will end in ruin. You must be prepared to counter their every move, deploying lethal defenses that can turn the tide, or your ritual will be forever undone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160570/extras/6fd625a39faf46be56213d56a3109af9.poster.avif?t=1761247782\" width=680 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160570/extras/6fd625a39faf46be56213d56a3109af9.webm?t=1761247782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160570/extras/6fd625a39faf46be56213d56a3109af9.mp4?t=1761247782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BALANCE POWER AND DEFENSE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between increasing your power or reinforcing your defenses. Will you sacrifice power for stronger runes, or invest in fortified towers, spells, gargoyle guardians, eldritch creatures and more devastating defenses to repel the onslaught? To survive, you must decide when to seize power and when to defend your stronghold. Every choice shapes your chances of succeeding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160570/extras/6c9d514f79b98f3810abe0d32fcb4aaa.poster.avif?t=1761247782\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160570/extras/6c9d514f79b98f3810abe0d32fcb4aaa.webm?t=1761247782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160570/extras/6c9d514f79b98f3810abe0d32fcb4aaa.mp4?t=1761247782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PROGRESS THROUGH DARK RITUALS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase your power as you progress from village to village, summoning each minor god until you are ready to call forth Ilur herself, the goddess of death. But be warned\u2014the stronger your magic, the more formidable your foes become. Only if you master both offense and defense will you achieve your ultimate vengeance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defy death. Embrace the darkness. <strong>The ritual must continue\u2014no matter the cost.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["TLR Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160570/df6ff9d94447c97951d3bd6d64d6e4a875037091/header.jpg?t=1761247782","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3160570/2046930193/3f00a9078aca017a870def00a80cbd772f564ad5/1761242140/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761242666","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3160570/2046930193/3f00a9078aca017a870def00a80cbd772f564ad5/1761242140/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761242666","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3160570/2046930193/3f00a9078aca017a870def00a80cbd772f564ad5/1761242140/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761242666","id":257058557,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257058557/movie480.mp4?t=1761242666","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257058557/movie_max.mp4?t=1761242666"},"name":"Runeomicon Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257058557/da4c693e292897f443d79bbfe5c8f2cdb4b269ac/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761242666","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257058557/movi